<p>YA JAFARE SADIQ a.s</p>

<p>Matam jahan me jafare sadiq ka hai bapa,<br />
Sar se humare uthgaya saya Imam ka,</p>

<p>Haye ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
1) Ay deen ke masiha , moula o muqtada<br />
Kaisa sitam hua , zehre daga diya<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
2) Ya rab yeh kya hua , kya zulm hogaya<br />
Be jurm o be Qata , moula guzar gaya<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
3) Nafse payambari , hum shaane Hyderi<br />
Rote hai jafari , moula ne ki Qaza<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
4) Mansoore be adab, dhaaya jo ye ghazab<br />
ye zulme be sabab, moula pa ki jafa<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
5) Yeh majlise Aza , hoti hai jo bapa<br />
Aati hai Fatima , karti hai yeh buka<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
6) Aaye hai panjetan , lab par hai yeh suqan<br />
Baqir ke janotan , kaisi hui jafa<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
7) Tha hashr ka sama , magmoom tha jahan<br />
Rote the inso jaa'n , kazim ne jab kaha<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
8) Ay Nasere Aza , kehke basad buka<br />
Matam karo bupa , jafer ne ki Qaza<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>

<p>
9) Bas rokle Qalam , ghash hogaye haram<br />
Hyder bachashme nam , noha jo yeh likha<br />
 Ya jafare sadiq , haye ya jafare sadiq</p>